Hi <%= @interviewer&.full_name %>,

An interview has been booked with you.

Candidate: <%= @candidate.name %>
Email:     <%= @candidate.email.presence || "not on file" %>
When:      <%= @when_text %>
<% if @candidate.phone.present? -%>
Phone:     <%= @candidate.phone %>
<% end -%>

<% if @join_url.present? -%>
JOIN THE INTERVIEW
<%= @join_url %>
<% else -%>
JOIN THE INTERVIEW
You've been added as a guest on the calendar invitation — the joining details
are on that invite.
<% end -%>

<% if @resume_attached -%>
Their resume is attached to this email.
<% else -%>
No resume file was available to attach.
<% end -%>

AFTER THE INTERVIEW
Please fill in your feedback here — it takes about a minute and needs no login:
<%= @feedback_url %>

Keep this email: that link is how the hiring team receives your assessment.

The candidate booked this slot themselves and cannot reschedule it. If they
cancel, they are moved out of the interview stage automatically.
